<ul>
  <li><strong>SS (Short/Short):</strong> most configs feasible. Optimal = TP2 at 1.2 GHz (0.97 Wh). Baseline TP8@2.0 GHz costs 1.35 Wh &#8212; <strong>39% more energy</strong>.</li>
