<div class="callout callout-green">
  <strong>Key insight:</strong> running everything at TP8@2.0 GHz wastes 39&#8211;40% more energy on SS and MM requests. And SS/MM requests dominate real workloads &#8212; in Azure's Conversation trace, medium-length requests (ML) are the most common type.
</div>
</section>

<section id="s-arch" data-code="arch">
<div class="section-no">04 &#8212; Architecture</div>
<h2>A Three-Tier Hierarchy of Controllers</h2>
<p>A globally optimal solver that considers all knobs simultaneously takes hundreds of milliseconds per decision &#8212; too slow for real-time adaptation. DynamoLLM decomposes the problem hierarchically: each tier controls its own knob, assumes lower tiers run at max performance, and operates at the frequency its overhead allows.</p>

